    "name": "PseudoCo Identity",
    "description": "Containment for AI Trust Lab 5 (Verify: Cisco Identity Intelligence). Disables the room's victim persona in Duo through the Duo Admin API and reads Lab 5 personas' Duo status. NOT a simulator: results carry simulated=false. It only ever disables the victim configured on the asset, refuses trusted personas and l5-* participant accounts, and has no undo.",
